category":"Nightlife","historical_business_count":5},{"category":"Bars","historical_business_count":5}],"history":[{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Bars, Cocktail Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":4},{"business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"Bars, Cocktail Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":4},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"cQrpOysPJFa3B_WEHsNSqQ","review_id":"Kr9ufKJ3QZnpqhTchtCZKw","date":"2017-05-09T12:42:59","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9344882965087891,"text_excerpt":"Typical Bourbon fare daiquiri, but atypical service. Christina was fantastic. Checked on us several times throughout the duration of our visit. Also, no idea what's in the Sangria daiquiri but it's delicious. It's probably on the weaker side, but I'm not really sure since we'd already had a lot to drink by this point, but I was in love with the daiquiri here. The pizza wasn't bad either. Friendly staff and good food and drinks. Definitely a win for the french quarter."},{"business_id":"cQrpOysPJFa3B_WEHsNSqQ","review_id":"CH1t8g3OXzRTlLqIxwWRQQ","date":"2016-06-20T01:17:40","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9322068095207214,"text_excerpt":"Came here on an empty stomach before I started drinking on Bourbon Street. I ordered two pepperoni pizzas which are $4 and they tasted great even though it was a bit greasy but did a great job! I did not buy any daiquiris or beer I did get a water and the bartender was a sweetheart which they need more of those on Bourbon! They do give you free samples of which daiquiri you'd like to try. They also carry beer and Jell-O shots. Bartenders don't push to sell their drinks which I also liked unlike those shot girls from the other bars. Great music and neon decor, definitely try the pizza makes great drunk food!"},{"business_id":"cQrpOysPJFa3B_WEHsNSqQ","review_id":"HJhhmkq1i_gD0f9Q2mUSOQ","date":"2018-08-10T02:18:48","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9281187057495117,"text_excerpt":"I stumbled upon this place, literally, after an evening at one of the bars on Bourbon Street. I'm always hungry after drinking and noticed pizzas being served so in I went. ATMOSPHERE: If I remember correctly, one side of the open-air eatery had a bar with daiquiri machines, the other side served up pizzas. There were a few tables inside but most of their business is take out as you can drink on the streets, just like Las Vegas. Love that! MENU: Daiquiris, cocktails, beer, hurricanes, pizza. FOOD: I got a slice of pepperoni/cheese for my spouse and a slice of peperoni/cheese/pork for me. My spouse fell asleep so I ended up eating both Costco-sized slices. They were thin crusted, chewy and..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"cQrpOysPJFa3B_WEHsNSqQ","photo_id":"M1gxmePGjmNuQLBEsZkckg","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/M1gxmePGjmNuQLBEsZkckg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.963387